WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.912 --> 00:00:05.198
 The interior of your home
is a self-reflection of who you

00:00:05.198 --> 00:00:05.865
are as a person.

00:00:05.865 --> 00:00:08.189
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:08.189 --> 00:00:11.550
So much of interior
design can seem daunting.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:13.870
There's so many choices
that are available.

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:16.230
I'm going to teach you
how to find your style,

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:18.030
how to work with
pattern, and how

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.467
to use lighting so
everyone can look good

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:21.675
who comes over to your house.

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:30.090
Go into your closet.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:32.100
Take a few of the
articles of clothing

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.110
and drape them across
your living room,

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.220
and see like, oh my
god, I love that color!

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:39.070
So what you look good in,
you're going to feel good in.

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:44.090
In every project,
this is how I start.

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:45.360
I call these vibe trays.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:48.840
It keeps the materials
in one place.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:51.260
We have stone, tile, wood.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:53.460
All of these textures
work together.

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:56.810
And that's what I love,
is being experimental.

00:00:56.810 --> 00:00:59.720
Color is absolutely
nothing to be afraid of.

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:02.720
Living without color is
like living without love.

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:04.790
It evokes so many emotions.

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:07.113
Yellow makes everyone happy.

00:01:07.113 --> 00:01:08.780
There are many things
you can do to make

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:10.550
a small space feel larger.

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:13.760
For example, having pieces
that are up on legs,

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:16.400
or a coffee table
that maybe has glass.

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:19.610
High gloss paint can
really expand the space,

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:22.100
because you have
reflectiveness and dimension.

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:24.490
And it looks so [MUTED] good.

00:01:24.490 --> 00:01:25.430
[CHUCKLING]

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:28.930
I want to take some of
the mystery out of design,

00:01:28.930 --> 00:01:33.020
so you feel confident and you
can make incredible decisions,

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:34.160
and make a beautiful home.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:40.490
Stay curious, take risks, and
beautiful things will happen.

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:45.360
I'm Kelly Wearstler, and
this is my MasterClass.

